osmo-core ports protocol knowledge and test fixtures from other projects:

- Osmosis by Konrad Iturbe (MIT) - https://github.com/KonradIT/osmosis
  Protocol behaviour, DUML datalink handling, manifest decoding, and the golden
  manifest fixtures under osmo-core/tests/fixtures/.
- dimadesu/dji-remote (MIT) - DUML framing, CRCs (via Osmosis).
- xaionaro-go/djictl (CC0-1.0) - livestream command layouts via Osmosis.
- DJI Osmo-GPS-Controller-Demo - R-SDK GPS protocol reference, via Osmosis:
  https://github.com/dji-sdk/Osmo-GPS-Controller-Demo
